## Model card

- **Name:** GPT Realtime Whisper
- **Short description:** OpenAI’s streaming speech-to-text recognition endpoint for continuous real-time transcript deltas, live captioning, and speech timestamping (per local metadata).
- **Provider / access:** OpenAI realtime/transcription stack. Local metadata lists `openai/gpt-realtime-whisper`, 128K session context, and $0.006/min pricing.
- **Release / knowledge:** Not clearly established from accessible official sources in this pass. Knowledge cutoff not stated.
- **IDs:** `gpt-realtime-whisper`, `openai/gpt-realtime-whisper`.
- **Context window:** 128,000 tokens total per session (local metadata).
- **Modalities:** Audio input; text output.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $0.006 per minute ($0.36/hr) per local metadata.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary streaming speech-to-text model. Architecture/parameter details not publicly disclosed.

